{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"majinboo","id":"429823898792755210","is_bot":0,"username":"_majinboo"},"author_id":"429823898792755210","channel_id":"636020485460721684","content":"*Nico wakes up in a daze. It seems as though he’s been asleep for a lot longer than intended. His pleasant dreams of Sune must have made him not want to wake. He leaps out of bed and does a small jig to wake up and heads to the mess hall singing loudly of his love for Sune*","created_at":"2020-07-31T01:01:27.909000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738561938304270566","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"636020485460721684","content":"Ozgur wakes up with a filled with a sense of dread. Something terrible has happened. Getting up, he dons his chainmail, grabs his Greataxe and heads out the door, slamming it behind him.","created_at":"2020-07-31T06:46:05.647000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738648667023605791","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"majinboo","id":"429823898792755210","is_bot":0,"username":"_majinboo"},"author_id":"429823898792755210","channel_id":"636020485460721684","content":"*Nico comes back to his room sadder than usual after hearing Amaras song. He didn’t know her at all but the loss of the beauty of life makes him feel depressed. He pulls in panflute out and begins to play a somber tune. The happiness has just been drained from him today. He begins to sing a song he hasn’t sung in a long, long time.* \n“Home is behind\nThe world ahead\nAnd there are many paths to tread\nThrough shadow\nTo the edge of night\nUntil the stars are all alight\n\nMist and shadow\nCloud and shade\nAll shall fade\nAll shall fade” \n\n*He then turns over in his bed and begins to feel homesick for the first time in almost a decade.  He decides to try and sleep it off and goes to bed*","created_at":"2020-07-31T06:48:53.584000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738649371402436630","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
